# Extra PKGS snippet for compose-rootfs.sh.
# One XBPS package / template name per line. Comments and blank lines are ignored.
#
# Compose auto-includes this file from <OUT_DIR>/sourcing/generation/extra-pkgs
# unless SOURCING_EXTRAS=0. Official Void .xbps stay the default; names listed
# here are opt-in extras.
#
# Custom .xbps from xbps-src land in:
#   out/cache/void-packages/hostdir/binpkgs
# Compose adds -R for that directory (or SOURCING_BINPKGS) before official
# repos when it exists, so a same-name sourced package replaces the official
# one.

# hello
